      "boundary": "A prerequisite structure does not mean that everyone must learn through the same course sequence, nor does it mean that every mistake comes from a missing foundation. If a learner can already perform the foundational component reliably under the target conditions, a justified exemption can still be appropriate; the key question is whether the capabilities required by the final task are genuinely available.",
      "reflection": "If someone always prepared the ropes before Ji Heng’s navigation practice, which of his results could not actually prove that he could complete the whole task independently?"
