    "id": "0111-formative-assessment",
    "batchId": "batch-001",
    "categoryCode": "01",
    "fieldCode": "0111",
    "fieldTitle": "Education science",
    "fieldTitleZh": "教育科学",
    "title": "Before the Kiln Door Closes",
    "titleZh": "关上窑门以前",
    "summary": "Xiaohe’s finished cups are judged accurately, but too late for repairs. A test joint gives her evidence she can act on before submission, even though the fifth cup will miss the fair.",
    "summaryZh": "小禾收到的成品判断一直准确，却总在杯子已经无法修改以后才到来。当可检查的接缝证据在统一交件截止前出现，她第一次能让证据改变下一步动作，即使第五只杯子因此赶不上集市。",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "The campus fair at the end of the month was getting close. Xiaohe wanted five approved cups for a stall. She had already accumulated four, and clay, glaze, and firing fees had consumed more than half a month’s allowance. Yet her three most recent handled cups had all cracked at the base of the handle. Every finished piece in the pottery class was checked against the same standards, and a red string was tied to the handle of anything that failed. All three strings said the same thing: “Cracked at the base.”",
      "She first made the handle thicker, then on the next cup pressed the joint for longer, but the result after firing did not change. The inspections were not wrong, and she had not ignored the instructions. The problem was that by the time she saw the red string, the cup was already hard-fired. She could only work backward from “it cracked” and guess what had happened during forming, without being able to see the contact surface as it had been then. After the third red string went onto her toolbox, she became even less willing to change more things on a guess.",
      "The next time she worked, Teacher Chen did not touch her new cup first. He asked Xiaohe to use scrap clay from the same batch, at a similar firmness, to make a joint like the handle joint and cut it open immediately. The outside looked smooth, but inside was a long, narrow gap. Xiaohe made another test joint, treated the contact surface differently, and cut that one open too. The gap was much smaller. Only then did she return to the real cup, remove and reattach the handle, and write on a slip: “Make a same-clay test joint before submission.”",
      "To be ready for the fair, work in this batch had to be handed in to the drying racks on Monday. After that, the pieces still needed enough time to dry completely, then be bisque fired, glazed, and fired again. Before Monday’s submission, Xiaohe cut open the same-clay test joint for her fifth cup and found that one side still contained a narrow gap. If she submitted the cup unchanged, it could stay with the batch. If she rejoined the handle, she would need to allow the piece to dry properly again, and the finished cup would certainly miss the fair. Xiaohe took the cup off the submission tray, reworked the contact surface, and added another line to her note: “Clay is dry; after rejoining, allow it to dry again.”",
      "On the day of the fair, Xiaohe took only four cups to her stall. The cup stayed on the rack and dried slowly. With the next batch, it was bisque fired, glazed, and glaze fired; when it came out, the handle was intact. The teacher still checked the rim, wall, handle, and glaze against the original standards before recording a final pass. Xiaohe placed the three old red strings and the two test-joint notes in the same transparent bag and clipped it inside the lid of her toolbox. On the top slip, the words “dry again” had been slightly blurred by muddy water."
    ],
    "storyParagraphsZh": [
      "月底的校园集市越来越近。小禾想凑够五只合格的杯子摆摊，已经攒下四只，泥料、釉和烧制费也花掉了她大半个月的零用钱。偏偏最近连续三只带把杯都在把手根部开裂。陶艺班每件成品都会按同一标准检查，不合格的就在把手上系红绳；三根红绳写的都是“根部开裂”。",
      "她先把把手做厚，下一只又把接口压得更久，烧成后的结果却没有变。检查并没有错，也不是她没有按要求做；问题在于看到红绳时，杯子早已烧硬。她只能从“裂了”反推成形时哪里出了问题，却看不到当时的接触面。第三根红绳挂上工具箱后，她反而不敢再凭猜测改更多地方。",
      "下一次制作时，陈老师没有先碰她的新杯。他让小禾用同批、软硬相近的废泥做一个与杯把相同的试接，再当场切开。外面抹得很平，里面却留着一道细长空隙。小禾换了一块试泥，重新处理接触面后再切，空隙明显缩小。她这才回到真正的杯子，把把手拆下重接，并在纸条上写下：“交件前先做同泥试接。”",
      "这批作品要赶上集市，必须在周一统一交到干燥架；之后还要留足时间完全干燥，再素烧、上釉和复烧。周一交件前，小禾切开第五只杯子的同泥试接，发现一侧仍有窄缝。若按原样交件，她还能跟上这一批；若重接，就得重新留出干燥时间，成品肯定赶不上集市。她把杯子从交件托盘上拿下来，重新处理接触面，又在纸条上补了一行：“泥偏干，重接后重新干燥。”",
      "集市那天，小禾只带去了四只杯子。那只杯子留在架上慢慢干透，随后跟下一批完成素烧、上釉和复烧，出窑后把手完整。老师仍按原标准检查杯口、杯壁、把手和釉面，最后才记为合格。小禾把三根旧红绳和两张试接纸条放进同一个透明袋，夹在工具箱盖内侧；最上面那张纸上，“重新干燥”四个字被泥水晕开了一点。"
    ],
    "conceptName": "Formative assessment",
    "conceptNameZh": "形成性评价",
    "explanationParagraphs": [
      "Formative assessment involves gathering evidence while learning or work can still be changed, interpreting that evidence, and using it to decide the next teaching or learning action. The core is not “grading earlier” or “assessing more often,” but whether the evidence actually changes what happens next.",
      "Summative assessment still has its own role: it can determine whether a finished product meets the standard. The red strings in the story are not wrong; their limitation is that they can tell Xiaohe only where the finished cup failed. The cross-section of the same-clay test joint lets her see the state of the joint before submission, while the work can still be changed, and use that evidence to alter both her joining method and her schedule."
    ],
    "explanationParagraphsZh": [
      "形成性评价是在学习或作品仍然可以改变时取得证据，解释这些证据，并据此决定下一步教学或学习行动。核心不是“提前打分”或“多评几次”，而是证据是否真正改变接下来的做法。",
      "终结性评价仍然有自己的作用，可以在作品完成后判断是否达到标准。故事中的红绳并非错误；它的问题是只能告诉小禾最终哪里失败。同泥试接的剖面则让她在交件前、作品仍可修改时看见接缝状态，并据此改变接合方法和时间安排。"
    ],
