    "overallZh": "第四次悬停是新改动作，旧木块声却仍在前三次相同的第八拍收束。删掉滚奏不够，完全删掉木块又失去前面反复建立的完成点。保留前三次参照、只延后第四次同一声音，才让“还没落下”的方向和接腕后的完成同时成立；灯光只是沿用这个可听节点。",
    "overall": "The fourth suspension is a newly changed movement, while the old woodblock still closes on the same eighth beat used in the first three crossings. Thinning the electronic texture does not solve the mismatch, and removing the woodblock entirely removes the familiar point of completion. Keeping the first three references and delaying only the fourth return allows the sense of “not yet landed” and the eventual wrist catch to work together; the lighting simply reuses that audible cue.",
