    "overallZh": "保留原稿后，多个动词才显出可重复变化：早期原形持续出现，随后called、checked等规则过去时增多，同时出现goed、buyed等过度概括；后来went、bought和新的规则形式进入准备充分的书写，而临时电话仍会出现原形。样本支持一个正在变化的系统，但不能把书写／口语差异归因于单一压力因素。",
    "overall": "Once the original pages are preserved, repeated change becomes visible across several verbs: early bare forms persist, then regular past forms such as called and checked increase while overgeneralizations such as goed and buyed also appear. Later, went and bought and new regular forms appear in more prepared writing, while the unplanned phone call still contains a bare form. The samples support a changing system, but the spoken/written difference cannot be attributed to time pressure alone.",
