    "overall": "Six parents must each give twenty minutes to create a car-free street that every family can then use; families that do not volunteer are not excluded from the benefit. That makes “call me when you already have five” individually understandable, yet many such decisions can leave the sixth box empty. The new form mainly changes what commitments people can see and reduces uncertainty. It does not remove free access to the benefit, which is why Monday still has only four volunteers in the second week.",
    "overallZh": "每天六名家长各付出二十分钟，才能形成所有家庭都可使用的无车路；未轮值者并不会被排除在收益之外。因此“差一个再叫我”对单个人有现实理由，却可能让第六格一直空着。新表格主要改变了大家能看见的承诺和不确定性，没有改变免费受益的结构，所以第二周仍有一天只有四人。",
