    "storyBody": "Shen He is checking a virtual lifting device. The load is at rest both before and after the lift. The battery’s chemical-energy account falls from 60 J to 48 J, while the load–Earth gravitational potential energy increases by 8 J. At first, the interface shows only those two entries, so her immediate question is, “Twelve are gone, only eight raised the load—where did the other four go?”\n\nShe opens the full-system boundary. The teaching system is defined to include the battery, motor, load, Earth, and other device components, and during this interval it exchanges no matter, heat, work, or radiation with the surroundings. K is 0 at both endpoints. Earth is included because gravitational potential energy belongs to the load–Earth relationship, not because Earth is physically placed inside the device.\n\nThe complete account is E_total = E_battery_chemical + U_battery_other + U_gravity + K + U_device_other. The model further specifies that the battery’s internal energy other than the separately listed chemical account changes by 0 during the interval, while the motor and other device components gain 4 J of internal energy in total. Other internal energy and gravitational potential energy use their initial values as zero references; this does not mean the components have zero absolute internal energy. Relative accounts are 60+0+0+0+0=60 J initially and 48+0+8+0+4=60 J finally.\n\nShen He then writes the changes term by term: battery chemical energy −12 J, battery other internal energy 0, gravitational potential energy +8 J, kinetic energy 0, and motor/other-device internal energy +4 J, totaling 0. The +4 J is given by the model in advance; it is not an unclosed difference relabeled as “heat.” If heat Q existed, it would represent energy transferred across a boundary, not another stored “heat account.”\n\nNext she shrinks the boundary to the battery alone. Its chemical account is still 60→48 J, and the model also states that the battery’s other internal-energy change is 0, so the battery subsystem’s total stored-energy change is −12 J. The interface therefore shows a net outward transfer of 12 J across the battery boundary into the external device during that interval. Without the given condition that the battery’s other internal energy is unchanged, the chemical-account drop alone would not establish an exactly 12 J drop in total stored battery energy.\n\nFinally, Shen He puts the two windows side by side: the full system shows total relative accounts 60 J→60 J, while the battery subsystem shows ΔE=−12 J and a net outward transfer of 12 J during the same interval. She selects “useful-lift fraction” in the results field and enters 8/12=2/3≈66.7%. Then she clicks back through the full-system and battery windows, checking which boundary gives 60→60 and which gives −12 J. The screen retains separate labels for the fraction and both accounts.",
    "storyBodyZh": "沈禾在检查一个虚拟小升降装置。提升前后负载都静止，电池化学账户从60 J降到48 J，负载—地球重力势能增加8 J。界面最初只显示这两项，于是她第一眼看到的是“少了12，只抬高8，另外4去哪了”。\n\n她点开完整系统边界。教学系统定义为电池、电机、负载、地球和其他装置部件，并设定这段时间不与外界交换物质、热、功或辐射；两个端点K都为0。这里把地球纳入的是负载—地球重力势能关系，不是把地球当实体装进装置。\n\n完整账户写成E_total = E_battery_chemical + U_battery_other + U_gravity + K + U_device_other。模型进一步给定：电池除化学账户外的其他内能在这段时间变化为0；电机和其他装置部件的内能合计增加4 J。其他内能和重力势能选起点为零参考值，并非部件绝对内能为零。起点相对账户为60+0+0+0+0=60 J，终点48+0+8+0+4=60 J。\n\n沈禾把变化量逐项写开：电池化学能−12 J，电池其他内能0，重力势能+8 J，动能0，电机/其他部件内能+4 J，合计0。这里+4 J是模型预先给定项，不是把未闭合差额猜成“发热”；热Q若存在，应表示跨边界传递，而不是系统里再存一份“热账户”。\n\n接着她把边界缩到只圈电池。此时电池化学账户仍是60→48 J，而模型又规定电池其他内能变化为0，所以这个电池子系统的总储存能变化就是−12 J；界面相应显示该时段12 J能量净传出电池边界，进入外部装置。若没有“电池其他内能不变”这条给定，就不能只凭化学账户下降推出电池总储存能也恰好下降12 J。\n\n最后沈禾把两个窗口并排：完整系统显示总相对账户60 J→60 J，电池子系统显示ΔE=−12 J和同期净传出12 J。她在结果栏选择“有用提升比例”，填入8/12=2/3≈66.7%；随后依次点回完整系统和电池窗口，核对60→60与−12 J分别对应哪条边界。屏幕保留了比例与两本账各自的标签。",
    "explanation": "The model explicitly gives battery-other internal-energy change Δ=0 and motor/other-component internal-energy change +4 J, so the full account is 60→48+0+8+0+4=60 J. The +4 J is not inferred from a residual and renamed as heat.\n\nFor the battery-only boundary, total stored-energy change can be written as −12 J only because the model separately states that nonchemical battery internal energy is unchanged. 8/12≈66.7% is only the defined useful-lift fraction, not the fraction of total energy remaining.",
    "explanationZh": "模型明确给定电池其他内能Δ=0、电机/其他部件内能+4 J，所以完整账为60→48+0+8+0+4=60 J；+4 J不是由差额猜成热。\n\n只圈电池时，总储存能变化可写成−12 J，是因为模型另给电池非化学内能不变。8/12≈66.7%只是有用提升比例，不是总能量剩余比例。"
