      "boundary": "The invariant depends on the current state space and the full set of allowed operations. Different invariant values are sufficient to rule out reachability; matching values are not sufficient. If the button set changes, preservation must be checked again, but adding a new button does not automatically mean the current parity property is broken. This proof concerns arbitrary finite legal sequences.",
