    "overall": "Mass balance is illustrated here with fictional trial data: over the same system boundary and time period, total mass input minus total mass output equals the change in total mass accumulated inside the system. In ordinary non-nuclear chemical reactions, reaction does not create a net generation or consumption of total mass, while individual components can be generated or consumed and therefore require separate component balances.",
