    "collection": "field-core-fables",
    "storyBody": "At the night-shift handover, the processing plant still has some spare capacity. Shen Zhou must decide whether a batch of copper-bearing material that has already been mined and delivered to the plant should go directly onto the conveyor tonight. The loader is waiting in front of the feed bin for his signal. The assay still reads 0.8%, similar to several recent batches that were processed without hesitation, so this would normally be a quick decision.\n\nSimilar material had previously been estimated at about 80% recovery, but the afternoon test gives only about 50%. The grade is unchanged, so each tonne still contains the same amount of copper; less of it is now expected to be recovered. The material is already mined, and the processing line has spare capacity tonight. Shen Zhou takes out his calculator to see whether the net recoverable value added by processing this tonne will cover the relevant cost.\n\nOne tonne is 1000 kg, so 0.8% means 8 kg of contained copper. Shen Zhou first uses 80% recovery and writes down 6.4 kg. At a net recoverable value of 10 accounting units per kilogram, that gives 64. The incremental cost directly associated with processing this tonne is 50, leaving 14. Under those earlier conditions, 0.8% still sits above the processing threshold.\n\nShen Zhou replaces the recovery estimate with the new figure of about 50%. The same 8 kg of contained copper would now yield an estimated 4 kg recovered, giving 40 accounting units of net value. Subtract the 50 units of relevant incremental cost and the result is -10. The driver leans out of the cab. “Into the bin?” Shen Zhou waves him off. “Take it to the holding area for now. We’ll wait until the recovery picture for this batch is clearer.” The assay still says 0.8%, but the loader turns the other way.\n\nThe loader follows the yellow line around the feed bin and unloads the material in the designated area nearby. Shen Zhou turns to the next item on the night-shift schedule. That section of processing capacity remains unused for the moment, and the material is still at the plant; when new recovery information arrives, it can be evaluated again.",
    "storyBodyZh": "夜班交接时，处理厂还有一段空余能力。沈舟要决定一批已经从矿下运到厂里的含铜物料今晚要不要直接上皮带；铲车停在进料仓前，司机等他一个手势。化验单仍是0.8%，和最近几批顺利处理的物料差不多，本来这应该是个很快的决定。\n\n此前相似物料的回收率估计约为80%，下午这次测试却只有约50%。品位没变，每吨里原本含有的铜量仍一样，估计能回收到的铜却少了。材料已经采出，今晚处理线又有闲置能力。沈舟拿出计算器，要先看这一吨进流程所增加的净回收价值，能不能抵上相关处理费用。\n\n一吨是1000 kg，0.8%含铜就是8 kg。沈舟先按80%回收，在纸上写下6.4 kg；再按每公斤10个账面单位的净回收价值，得到64。与处理这一吨直接相关的增量费用是50，64减50，还剩14。按此前这组条件，0.8%在账面上还能越过处理门槛。\n\n沈舟把回收率换成刚拿到的约50%。同样8 kg含铜，现在估计只能回收4 kg，净回收价值变成40；再减去50的相关增量费用，就是负10。司机从驾驶室探出头：“进仓吗？”沈舟摇手：“先去待处理区。等这批的回收情况再确认。”化验单上的0.8%没变，车头却换了方向。\n\n铲车沿黄线绕过进料仓，把物料卸到旁边的指定区域。沈舟转身去看下一批夜班调度。处理线那段空余能力暂时还空着，这一车物料也仍留在厂里；等新的回收信息出来，它还可以重新进入判断。",
    "explanation": "In this model, the processing threshold is the copper grade at which net recoverable value per tonne just covers the relevant incremental cost. Enter grade as a decimal: 0.8% becomes 0.008. Multiply grade by 1000 kg/t to obtain contained copper per tonne, then by recovery and net value per kilogram. Subtract the relevant incremental cost per tonne. The material is already mined, so mining costs already incurred are not counted again. Spare capacity also means the model includes no capacity opportunity cost for displacing other material.\n\nFix net recoverable value at 10 accounting units per kilogram and relevant incremental cost at 50 units per tonne. At 80% recovery, the threshold is 50÷(1000×0.80×10)=0.00625, or 0.625%. At 50% recovery it is 50÷(1000×0.50×10)=0.01, or 1.0%. The grade of 0.8% therefore lies above the first threshold and below the second. The cost categories must not overlap: the 50 units are relevant incremental processing costs not already included in the net value per kilogram. All values are fictional teaching assumptions.",
    "explanationZh": "本模型的处理阈值，是每吨物料的净回收价值刚好抵上相关增量费用时的含铜品位。计算时，品位用小数表示：0.8%代入0.008。每吨含铜量为品位×1000 kg/t，再乘回收率和每公斤的净回收价值，最后减去每吨相关增量费用。物料已采出，模型不重计已经发生的采矿成本；处理能力闲置，也不计挤走其他物料的产能机会成本。\n\n固定每公斤净回收价值为10个账面单位、每吨相关增量费用为50个单位。80%回收时，阈值为50÷(1000×0.80×10)=0.00625，即0.625%；50%回收时为50÷(1000×0.50×10)=0.01，即1.0%。0.8%因而在前者之上、后者之下。两种费用口径不得重复：50是尚未计入每公斤净价值的本次相关增量处理费用。这些数字均为教学虚构。"
