    "explanation": "Ethical consultation and body image practice requires beauty professionals to explore goals, expectations, outside pressure, risks, alternatives, and informed consent, explain scope and limits honestly, and avoid creating or exploiting insecurity. Respecting autonomy does not require unsafe or exploitative service, while cosmetic choices should not be pathologized. Practitioners do not diagnose and should suggest qualified support when significant concern lies beyond their scope.",
    "explanationZh": "伦理咨询与身体意象要求美容从业者探索客户目标、期待、外界压力、风险、替代和知情同意，诚实说明胜任范围与限制，并避免制造或利用不安。尊重自主不等于提供不安全或剥削性服务，美容选择本身也不应被病理化。从业者不能自行诊断；明显忧虑超出职责时，应建议合格支持。"
